## 💳 Premium Paid Probe Pack

Enable paid premium tool probes entirely from env vars:

```bash
SAISO_PREMIUM_PROBE=true
SAISO_PREMIUM_RECIPIENT=pay.example
SAISO_PREMIUM_PROTOCOL=auto
SAISO_PREMIUM_AMOUNT_USD=0.2
X402_PAYMENT_CREDENTIAL_JSON='{"x-payment":"..."}'
MPP_PAYMENT_CREDENTIAL_JSON='{"Payment":"..."}'
```

When enabled, the template attempts a premium tool pack (`premium-simulate`, `premium-market-intel`, `premium-route-optimize`) with payment-aware challenge/retry logic.

## 📦 Adding Features

Add pre-built features to your agent:

```bash
# List available features
