## 🆚 EVM vs SVM Server

**Choose EVM Server when:**
- Multi-chain EVM applications (30+ networks)
- Need ENS resolution and EVM-native tooling
- Working with ERC token/NFT standards
- Building broad DeFi integrations

**Choose SVM Server when:**
- Building Solana/SVM-native agent flows
- Optimizing for high-throughput, low-latency execution
- Working with SPL token ecosystems

